{1}{Hello...I welcome you, traveler...}{Hello...I welcome you, traveler...}{}{1}{}{gf1084 1, gf2070 1}
{2}{Greetings to you, Silver Lady.  I thank you for this audience...}{}{5}{}{10}{}
{10}{I know you've come far...and I've expected you for a long time, now...}{I know you've come far...and I've expected you for a long time, now...}{}{2}{}{}
{11}{I spoke to Pelonious Schuyler...he said something similar to me.}{}{5}{gf1022 1}{14}{}
{12}{What do you mean? }{}{5}{gf1022 0}{17}{}
{14}{Pelonious Schuyler...?  Ah, yes...I see him now...speaking with the dead...or is he among them?  It matters not, I suppose...they are all watching YOU...}{Pelonious Schuyler...?  Ah, yes...I see him now...speaking with the dead...or is he among them?  It matters not, I suppose...they are all watching YOU...}{}{3}{}{}
{15}{What?  What are you talking about?}{}{5}{}{17}{}
{17}{I've seen you approaching from both east and west, traveler...and you bring them with you, all of them...they've no choice but to follow...}{I've seen you approaching from both east and west, traveler...and you bring them with you, all of them...they've no choice but to follow...}{}{4}{}{}
{18}{Please...I don't understand...}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{20}{I know, I know...we speak different languages you and I.  The things I see, wrapped in the past and the present, and shrouded in the veils of magick...I cannot translate my visions into your own.  You must listen traveler, listen and learn to see...}{I know, I know...we speak different languages you and I.  The things I see, wrapped in the past and the present, and shrouded in the veils of magick...I cannot translate my visions into your own.  You must listen traveler, listen and learn to see...}{}{5}{}{}
{21}{I will try, Silver Lady...}{}{5}{}{23}{}
{23}{What is it you seek, traveler...?}{What is it you seek, traveler...?}{}{6}{}{}
{24}{Do you know if I'm the Living One?}{}{5}{}{29}{lf1 1}
{25}{The Black Mountain Clan...where are they?}{}{5}{}{40}{lf2 1, gf1082 1}
{26}{The name M'in Gorad...does it mean anything to you?}{}{5}{}{63}{lf3 1, gf1083 1}
{29}{The Living One?  [She laughs, musically...]  Oh, traveler, why would you think I would know of such a thing?...}{The Living One?  [She laughs, musically...]  Oh, traveler, why would you think I would know of such a thing?...}{}{7}{}{}
{30}{It's a prophecy...I assume you can see what is to come...}{}{5}{}{32}{}
{32}{[More laughter.]  It's an interesting thing about prophecies, traveler.  They're no clearer to one such as myself, living both in and out of the stream, than they are to you, walking the shore.  The flow swirls AROUND them, until they are ready.  And in the end, really, is it going to matter who someone pointed a finger at?}{[More laughter.]  It's an interesting thing about prophecies, traveler.  They're no clearer to one such as myself, living both in and out of the stream, than they are to you, walking the shore.  The flow swirls AROUND them, until they are ready.  And in the end, really, is it going to matter who someone pointed a finger at?}{}{8}{}{}
{33}{That would be comforting if people weren't trying to kill me...}{}{5}{}{35}{}
{35}{These people can only see what follows in your wake, traveler.  Pass your hand through the flame, and it flickers.  If you've tired of the mantle, then shed it.  Disappear. Otherwise, don't be surprised at what people do...[Laughter fading.]}{These people can only see what follows in your wake, traveler.  Pass your hand through the flame, and it flickers.  If you've tired of the mantle, then shed it.  Disappear. Otherwise, don't be surprised at what people do...[Laughter fading.]}{}{9}{}{}
{36}{You've a point, there.  And the Black Mountain Clan...?}{}{5}{lf2 0}{40}{lf2 1, gf1082 1}
{37}{And M'in Gorad?  What can you see of him?}{}{5}{lf3 0}{63}{lf3 1, gf1083 1}
{38}{No...but I understand almost none of what you said...}{}{5}{ lf2 1, lf3 1}{85}{}
{40}{Yes, I can see them...but the ravens are circling, and the storm rages but subsides, and yet there is lightning and then shadow, and then the storm howls again, tearing,...I can't even look at it...!}{Yes, I can see them...but the ravens are circling, and the storm rages but subsides, and yet there is lightning and then shadow, and then the storm howls again, tearing,...I can't even look at it...!}{}{10}{}{gf1072 1}
{41}{That makes no sense to me...}{}{5}{}{43}{}
{43}{Wait...oh! Look! They've taken in a small child with machine-dreams, and hands of hinged metal, and a heart in which coal burns brightly...}{Wait...oh! Look! They've taken in a small child with machine-dreams, and hands of hinged metal, and a heart in which coal burns brightly...}{}{11}{}{gf1073 1}
{44}{That's Gilbert Bates!  But that was in the past...}{}{5}{}{46}{}
{46}{I don't know of what you speak, traveler...please, listen...try to hear with MY ears...}{I don't know of what you speak, traveler...please, listen...try to hear with MY ears...}{}{12}{}{}
{47}{I don't know if I can....}{}{5}{}{49}{}
{49}{I see a flame atop a hill, burning so brightly!  And below, a field of wheat around a pool of water...and the flame spitting fire and consuming the wheat and the lake, and losing itself as well...}{I see a flame atop a hill, burning so brightly!  And below, a field of wheat around a pool of water...and the flame spitting fire and consuming the wheat and the lake, and losing itself as well...}{}{13}{}{gf1074 1}
{50}{Is there anything else?  The Clan...do you see anything else?}{}{5}{}{52}{}
{52}{It's dark here...so dark...and the flame is here, too...but this flame burns black onyx and cold, and shadow is its child...are they here as well?...I can't see that far...}{It's dark here...so dark...and the flame is here, too...but this flame burns black onyx and cold, and shadow is its child...are they here as well?...I can't see that far...}{}{14}{}{gf1075 1}
{53}{What else?}{}{5}{}{55}{}
{55}{A plain of mirrored glass, a sky of white, a lone figure.  Wait...which is the reflection?...I'm unsure...}{A plain of mirrored glass, a sky of white, a lone figure.  Wait...which is the reflection?...I'm unsure...}{}{15}{}{gf1076 1}
{56}{You're speaking in riddles, Silver Lady...}{}{5}{}{58}{}
{58}{That is all I see, traveler.  The riddle is created by you...do you have anything else you'd like to ask?}{That is all I see, traveler.  The riddle is created by you...do you have anything else you'd like to ask?}{}{16}{}{}
{59}{M'in Gorad...what can you tell me of that name?}{}{5}{lf3 0}{63}{lf3 1, gf1083 1}
{60}{Am I the Living One?}{}{5}{lf1 0}{29}{lf1 1}
{61}{No...but I understand almost none of what you said...}{}{5}{ lf2 1, lf3 1}{85}{}
{63}{M'in Gorad...an old name, traveler.  Oh...!  A man is screaming, and carves a key with his fingers, and the birds have plucked his eyes out...and the wolf watches, motionless, his paw in the air...}{M'in Gorad...an old name, traveler.  Oh...!  A man is screaming, and carves a key with his fingers, and the birds have plucked his eyes out...and the wolf watches, motionless, his paw in the air...}{}{17}{}{gf1077 1}
{64}{Is it M'in Gorad?  Is he dead?  And what does the wolf mean?}{}{5}{}{66}{}
{66}{A tear in the curtain, and only darkness beyond...a ragged wound, mended with a ring of blasted stone...}{A tear in the curtain, and only darkness beyond...a crooked finger points eastward, adorned with a ring of blasted stone...}{}{18}{}{gf1078 1}
{67}{What else?  What else do you see of M'in Gorad?}{}{5}{}{69}{}
{69}{A hand that sees, but is blinded...a man draped in truth, wearing a mask...}{A hand that sees, but is blinded...a man draped in truth, wearing a mask...}{}{19}{}{gf1079 1}
{70}{You've lost me...please...}{}{5}{}{72}{}
{72}{And they hide!  The lost children!  They hide!  A gray mist, even to me...but there!  He runs!  Dropping veined and painted leaves!  And the flock comes, talons outstretched and wings of fire, and he is consumed...but the leaves...! }{And they hide!  The lost children!  They hide!  A gray mist, even to me...but there!  He runs!  Dropping veined and painted leaves!  And the flock comes, talons outstretched and wings of fire, and he is consumed...but the leaves...! }{}{20}{}{gf1080 1}
{73}{What?}{}{5}{}{75}{}
{75}{Run quickly, traveler!  Find what was left behind!  In the place of smoke and water...he is there!  He is there!}{Run quickly, traveler!  Find what was left behind!  In the place of smoke and water...he is there!  He is there!}{}{21}{}{gf1081 1}
{76}{Who?  M'in Gorad?}{}{5}{}{78}{}
{78}{I see no more.  The stream is again calm.  Was there anything else?}{I see no more.  The stream is again calm.  Was there anything else?}{}{22}{}{}
{79}{Am I the Living One?}{}{5}{lf1 0}{29}{lf1 1}
{80}{What of the Black Mountain Clan?}{}{5}{lf2 0}{40}{lf2 1, gf1082 1}
{81}{No...but I understand almost none of what you said...}{}{5}{lf2 1, lf3 1}{85}{}
{85}{I know that, traveler.  But I also know that clarity is often the child of time.  Your answers lie both in front and behind...make sure not to overlook one for the other...}{I know that, traveler.  But I also know that clarity is often the child of time.  Your answers lie both in front and behind...make sure not to overlook one for the other...}{}{23}{}{lf4 1, ru 2057}
{86}{Characteristically cryptic, dear Lady...}{}{5}{}{}{fl 88}
{88}{[Her laughter comes again, from further away.]  I go now, traveler.  We will meet again...though I'm not sure on which side.  No matter.  Farewell...}{[Her laughter comes again, from further away.]  I go now, traveler.  We will meet again...though I'm not sure on which side.  No matter.  Farewell...}{}{24}{}{lf4 1}
{90}{[You hear a faint whisper, and soft laughter, but otherwise the Lady is still.]}{[You hear a faint whisper, and soft laughter, but otherwise the Lady is still.]}{}{25}{}{}
{97}{Hello again, traveler...}{Hello again, traveler...}{}{26}{}{}
{98}{Hello, Silver Lady...I've one more question to ask you...}{}{5}{}{101}{}
{99}{Uh...who?  I never been here...}{}{-4}{}{101}{}
{101}{Yes...I knew you'd return to me.  And it seems that you still walk the shore...this gladdens me...}{Yes...I knew you'd return to me.  And it seems that you still walk the shore...this gladdens me...}{}{27}{}{}
{102}{Why?}{}{5}{}{105}{}
{103}{Whu?  What you talkin' about?}{}{-4}{}{105}{}
{105}{It means that you've chosen the right path, traveler.  At least, right in the way that YOU see things.  I am happy for you...}{It means that you've chosen the right path, traveler.  At least, right in the way that YOU see things.  I am happy for you...}{}{28}{}{}
{106}{May I ask you something?}{}{5}{}{109}{}
{107}{Ummm...got question, ghost lady!}{}{-4}{}{109}{}
{109}{Of course.  What is the question?}{Of course.  What is the question?}{}{29}{}{}
{110}{What am I to do next?  Please, try to be clear...}{}{5}{}{113}{}
{111}{What I 'sposed to do next?}{}{-4}{}{113}{}
{113}{[Silence...]}{[Silence...]}{}{30}{}{}
{114}{Silver Lady?}{}{5}{}{117}{}
{115}{Uh...ghost lady?}{}{-4}{}{117}{}
{117}{[More silence...]}{[More silence...]}{}{31}{}{}
{118}{Ahem...}{}{5}{}{121}{}
{119}{You still there, lady...?}{}{-4}{}{121}{}
{121}{Your answer lies with Nasrudin.}{Your answer lies with Nasrudin.}{}{32}{}{gf1088 1, qu1024 2, ss 16, ru 2058}
{122}{What?  How is that possible?}{}{5}{}{125}{}
{123}{Na-s-ru-d-d-in-n?  What that?}{}{-4}{}{125}{}
{125}{[Her voice is fading already, underlined with that musical laughter...]  You have your answer, traveler. [Only a whisper...] We won't be speaking again...}{[Her voice is fading already, underlined with that musical laughter...]  You have your answer, traveler. [Only a whisper...] We won't be speaking again...}{}{33}{}{}
{126}{Wait...who?}{}{5}{}{}{fl 90}
{127}{I no unnerstand, ghost-lady...wait!}{}{-4}{}{}{fl 90}

